		(property "Description" "WE-CAIR Air coil\n\nCharacteristics\nInductance values from 1.65nH up to 120 nH\nVery high quality factor >100\nHigh self-resonant frequency\nHigh currents up to 3.5 A\n5%(10%) Inductance tolerance\nPick and place process possible\nGood solderability (Tinned connector pins)\nOperating temperature: –40 °C to +125 °C\n\nApplications\nEspecially for RF application\nIdeal for high current applications\nBroad band filter\nRF-Decoupling\n\nhttp://katalog.we-online.de/media/images/v2/Family_WE-CAIR_4C.jpg\n\nDetails see: http://katalog.we-online.de/en/pbs/WE-CAIR http://katalog.we-online.de/en/pbs/WE-CAIR\n\nCreated on 2014-05-19\n2014 (C) Wurth Elektronik"
